Over the next several minutes, you explain the behind-the-scenes events from the Khor'minoan feast, along with Calise's plans for one grand battle to destroy the demons' spawning pits. The thought of doing that much damage to the demons seems to resonate with the hunter-[etheryn.crowned
    |queen
    |princess
], and she clenches her fingers around the hem of her skirts, balling them into fists. "Okay. If you think you a[ryn.lowConfidence
    |-a real
] battle is the right call, I'll do whatever I can to help you win!"

You [pc.dcb
    |give her a firm nod
    |ruffle her hair
    |squish her into a hug
]. "I knew I could count on you."

Etheryn gives you a wan smile. "You helped me take this throne, [pc.name]. I owe it to you to help now when you need it. When the <b>world</b> needs it."

<b>You've recruited the Boreal Rangers.</b>

rows.translation:
“小琳，”你一边说，一边[atFH
    |把自己的座位挪近了些
    |坐得[atCamp
        |近了些
        |到了她王座的扶手上
    ]
]。哈里克[ryn.highConfidence
    |亲昵地朝你叫了一声
    |警惕地眯眼望着你
]。“你觉得眼下能抽调多少士兵？”

“士兵？一个都没有。”小琳皱起眉头，“我们[ryn.lowConfidence
    |几、
]几乎没有士兵！只有[ryn.lowConfidence
    |寥、
]寥寥几名王宫守卫。”

真他妈糟糕。“那你们<b>到底</b>有什么？总得有些能打的人吧。”

小琳抿起嘴唇，思索片刻。“我们可以召集[ryn.lowConfidence
    |民、
]民兵。王宫里发生的事，让我们失去了大多数拥有重甲和军用武器的人。但王国里还有[ryn.lowConfidence
    |许、
]许多[ryn.lowConfidence
    |会、
]会用弓或长矛的人，比如猎人。身为[etheryn.crowned
    |女王
    |摄政公主
]，有需要时我可以征召人民参战。”

“很快就会需要他们了。”你告诉她。

接下来的几分钟里，你向她说明了科尔米诺斯宴会背后的种种事件，以及卡莉丝准备以一场大战摧毁恶魔孵化坑的计划。想到能给恶魔造成如此重创，猎人出身的[etheryn.crowned
    |女王
    |公主
]显然深受触动；她攥紧裙摆，手指握成了拳。“好。如果你认为[ryn.lowConfidence
    |真、真是
]打一场真正的大战才是正确选择，我会尽我所能帮你取胜！”

你[pc.dcb
    |郑重地朝她点头
    |揉了揉她的头发
    |一把将她搂进怀里
]。“我就知道可以依靠你。”

伊瑟琳勉强露出一丝微笑。“是你帮我夺回了这个王位，[pc.name]。如今你需要帮助，<b>世界</b>需要帮助，我理应伸出援手。”

<b>你已招募极北游骑兵。</b>

rows.original:
A short while later, you[party.has calise
    | and Calise
] are sitting in a small private study, lit by a cozy fire and a number of luminous fungus-filled lanterns. Scrolls and tomes overflow from shelves chiseled into the stone walls, and are stacked man-high behind imported wooden tables and a couch big enough for the towering king to recline upon.

You'd heard Kelsaz was [silly
    |a big fucking nerd
    |a scholar
], but it's nice to see that rumor's more than true.[var0
    | Honestly, it reminds you of home. The scent of all that parchment... there's a deep nostalgia to it. You wonder how much of this collection you've read yourself.
]

Kelsaz pours you a goblet of wine before sitting back on his couch, leaving you to take a seat across from him on a[pc.isHeight 84
    |n equally minotaur-sized chair
    | Varena-sized chair
]. "You've done more for this city than anyone could have asked for," the king says slowly. "I meant what I said out there: you will always be welcome here in Khor'minos. If there is anything within my power to grant you as a reward for what you have done..."

[party.has calise
    |[kasyrra.romantic
        |Calise drapes her arms around your shoulder, resting her chin atop your head.
        |Calise stands straight, hands behind her back.
    ] "If it please the king, all I would ask is permanent ownership of the estate you've been hosting me in. I plan to stay in the Frost Marches for a while, and I've grown fond of my little home away from home."

    Kelsaz gives her a genuine smile. "Then you shall have it. It will be our honor to host you so long as you would remain with us, Lady Calise. And you, [pc.name]? What would you have of us?"
]

rows.translation:
过了一会儿，你[party.has calise
    |和卡莉丝
]正坐在一间小巧的私人书房里，室内由温暖的炉火和几盏装满发光真菌的明亮灯笼照亮。石墙里凿出的书架上堆满了卷轴和典籍，还有成堆高过人头的书册倚在进口的木桌和一张大到足以让那位高大国王斜倚的沙发后面。

你早就听说凯尔萨兹是个[silly
    |十足的书呆子
    |学者
]，但很高兴看到这个传闻不只是真的。[var0
    |说实话，这里会让你想起家乡。那些羊皮纸的气味……其中有一种深深的乡愁。你不禁想知道，这些藏书里有多少是你自己读过的。
]

凯尔萨兹给你倒了一杯酒，然后靠回自己的沙发上，让你在他对面的[pc.isHeight 84
    |一张与弥诺陶洛斯体型相当的椅子
    |一张瓦蕾娜尺寸的椅子
]上坐下。“你为这座城市所做的，比任何人所能要求的都多，”国王缓缓说道。“我说的是真心话：在科尔米诺斯，你永远都会受到欢迎。如果有什么在我能力范围之内、可以作为对你所作所为的奖赏赐予你的东西……”

[party.has calise
    |[kasyrra.romantic
        |卡莉丝把双臂环在你的肩上，下巴搁在你头顶。
        |卡莉丝挺直身子站着，双手背在身后。
    ]“如果国王允许，我唯一的请求，就是永久拥有您一直让我居住的那处宅邸。我打算在霜冻边境再待上一段时间，而且我已经喜欢上了我这个远离家乡的小家。”

    凯尔萨兹真心实意地对她笑了笑。“那它就是你的了。只要您愿意留在我们身边，能招待您是我们的荣幸，卡莉丝女士。那么您呢，[pc.name]？您想向我们要点什么？”
]
